## Hydrotherapy

::bg{location="hydro" time="night"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: White tile to the ceiling. Three deep tubs with canvas lids buckled across them, the buckles on the outside.
@narrator{code="0020"}: The middle tub is full to the brim with black water. Something small and bright lies on the bottom: a brass key, turning very slowly in no current at all.
@narrator{code="0030"}: On the wall, a manifold of valves: one blue, one red, and a chain with a porcelain handle marked DRAIN.
@nell{code="0010" mono}: Hot, cold and let go. They kept people in those for days.
